WEBVTT

00:03:00.676 --> 00:03:01.928
But masculinity,

00:03:01.928 --> 00:03:03.679
in certain forms,

00:03:03.679 --> 00:03:05.389
can harm women,

00:03:05.389 --> 00:03:06.682
girls,

00:03:06.682 --> 00:03:08.184
nonbinary people

00:03:08.184 --> 00:03:09.477
and men

00:03:09.477 --> 00:03:11.312
through violence,

00:03:11.312 --> 00:03:12.647
dominating power

00:03:12.647 --> 00:03:13.648
and control.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:15.691
So how do we address this?

00:03:17.735 --> 00:03:20.529
How can we men step up

00:03:20.529 --> 00:03:22.657
and better support our daughters,

00:03:22.657 --> 00:03:24.325
our sisters,

00:03:24.325 --> 00:03:26.035
our female partners,

00:03:26.035 --> 00:03:28.120
our colleagues, neighbors and friends?

00:03:29.997 --> 00:03:34.585
Through what means can men both instigate
and lead a gender reckoning?